      "gearTypeSource": "Rubber shock cord in the leather boots on the legs -- Ty 2026-11-10: \"The cub bungees are in the black leather bags on the gear legs\" (the model draws them: Shock_Boot_L/R). A bungee stores and gives back: \"no rebound but plenty of travel\", which is what the gear does -- its damper only ever sees the closing rate -- and why a Cub bounces.",
